  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The area of a square is <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math> square inches. What is the side length, in inches, of this square?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
    {
      "id": "6bf174fa-7347-4bbd-b157-d6c8d34b05a4",
      "content": "<p><math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math></p>"
